    "The stationary forward and actual parameterized-circle-inverse providers derive all positive spatial jets from the actual raw drift and speed towers. No flow-jet bound or inverse-angle lower is assumed.",
    "C0, the single low order, common derivative loss and the entire B tower precede state, component, original host j, factor g, strip radius R, nonzero scale delta, selected flow, angle and time. The forward n-1 indexing is explicitly converted to n for n>=1.",
    "A numerical maximum combines the two true material scales without changing T or sample j; positive E0 and the already derived scaled floor justify all changes of base.",
    "The proof uses one common monotonic-envelope calculation for both input fields and both outputs. Both endpoints are handled by the existing Bool orientation."
  ],
